re transparent in a way.\r\n\r\nI should also ask, should this PR also add documentation for the `GDScriptFunctionState` class? If it becomes accessible, it should probably be documented.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3945715047/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null}]